#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:2
msgid "Power Scheduling"
msgstr "Planification d'alimentation"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:4
msgid ""
"Set weekly schedules for shutdown and startup times for Instances and "
"VM's, apply Power Schedules to Instances pre or post-provisioning, apply "
"Power Schedule policies on Group or Clouds, or use Guidance to "
"automatically recommend and apply optimized Power Schedules."
msgstr "Establezca programaciones semanales pour les horarios de apagado e inicio de Instances et VM, aplique Programaciones de energía a Instances antes ou después du aprovisionamiento, aplique políticas de Planification d'alimentation dans Groupes ou Clouds, ou utilice la Orientación pour recomendar et aplicar automáticamente Programaciones de energía optimizadas."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:7
msgid "Create Power schedules"
msgstr "Créer des planifications d'alimentation"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:9
msgid "Navigate to |LibAutPow|"
msgstr "Accédez à |LibAutPow|"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:10
#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:60
msgid "Select :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Sélectionnez :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:11
msgid "Configure the following options:"
msgstr "Configurez les options suivantes :"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:13
#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:64
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:14
msgid "Name of the Power Schedule"
msgstr "Nom de la planification d'alimentation"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:15
#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:66
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:16
msgid "Description for the Power Schedule"
msgstr "Description de la planification d'alimentation"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:17
msgid "TIME ZONE"
msgstr "TIME ZONE"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:18
msgid "Time Zone the Power Schedule times correlate to."
msgstr "Zona horaria a la que corresponden les horarios de la Planification d'alimentation."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:19
msgid "TYPE"
msgstr "TYPE"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:20
msgid "Power On"
msgstr "Power On"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:21
msgid "Power Up and then Down at scheduled times"
msgstr "Power On et luego apagar dans les horarios programados"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:22
msgid "Power off"
msgstr "Power off"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:23
msgid "Power Down then Up at scheduled times"
msgstr "Power off et luego encender dans les horarios programados"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:24
#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:68
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Activé"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:25
msgid "Check for Power Schedule to be Active. Uncheck to disable Power Schedule."
msgstr "Marque pour que la Planification d'alimentation esté activa. Desmarque pour deshabilitar la Planification d'alimentation."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:26
msgid "DAYS"
msgstr "DAYS"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:27
msgid ""
"Slide the start and end time controls for each day to configure each days"
" Schedule. Green sections indicate Power on, red sections indicate Power "
"Off. Time indicated applies to selected Time Zone. The sliders can be "
"used to set time in 15-minute steps, for single-minute granularity click "
"the pencil icon and enter a specific time down to the minute."
msgstr "Deslice les controles de hora de inicio et fin pour cada día pour configurar la programación de cada día. Las secciones verdes indican encendido, les secciones rojas indican apagado. El horario indicado se aplica a la zona horaria seleccionada. Los deslizadores se peutn usar pour establecer le tiempo dans pasos de 15 minutos; pour granularidad de un solo minuto, cliquez dans le icono de lápiz e ingrese una hora específica au minuto."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:29
msgid ".. image:: /images/operations/powerSchedule.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:31
#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:42
#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:52
#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:91
msgid "Select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Sélectionnez :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:33
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "Conseil"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:33
msgid ""
"To view the Instances a power schedule is currently set on, select the "
"name of a Power Schedule to go to the Power Schedule Detail Page."
msgstr "Para ver les Instances dans les que una programación de energía est configurada actualmente, seleccione le nombre de una Planification d'alimentation pour ir a la página de detalle de la Planification d'alimentation."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:36
msgid "Add Power Schedule to Instance"
msgstr "Agregar Planification d'alimentation a una Instance"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:38
msgid "Navigate to :menuselection:`Provisioning --> Instances`"
msgstr "Accédez à :menuselection:`Provisioning --> Instances`"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:39
msgid "Select an Instance"
msgstr "Sélectionnez una Instance"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:40
#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:49
msgid "Select :guilabel:`EDIT`"
msgstr "Sélectionnez :guilabel:`EDITAR`"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:41
#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:51
msgid "In the POWER SCHEDULE dropdown, select a Power Schedule."
msgstr "En le menú desplegable PROGRAMACIÓN DE ENERGÍA, seleccione una Planification d'alimentation."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:45
msgid "Add Power Schedule to Virtual Machine"
msgstr "Agregar Planification d'alimentation a una máquina virtual"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:47
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Compute > Virtual Machines``"
msgstr "Accédez à ``Infrastructure > Compute > Virtual Machines``"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:48
msgid "Select a Virtual Machine"
msgstr "Sélectionnez una máquina virtual"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:50
msgid "Expand the Advanced Options section"
msgstr "Expanda la sección de Opciones avanzadas"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:55
msgid "Add Power Schedule Policy"
msgstr "Agregar política de Planification d'alimentation"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:57
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Note"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:57
msgid ""
"Power Schedule Policies apply to Instances created after the Policy is "
"enabled."
msgstr "Las políticas de Planification d'alimentation se aplican a les Instances creadas después de que la política esté habilitada."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:59
msgid "Navigate to |AdmPol|"
msgstr "Accédez à |AdmPol|"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:61
msgid "Select TYPE `Power Schedule`"
msgstr "Sélectionnez TIPO `Power Schedule`"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:62
msgid "Configure the Power Schedule Policy:"
msgstr "Configure the Planification d'alimentation Policy:"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:65
msgid "Name of the Policy"
msgstr "Nombre de la política"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:67
msgid "Add details about your Policy for reference in the Policies tab."
msgstr "Agregue detalles sobre su política pour referencia dans la pestaña de Políticas."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:69
msgid ""
"Policies can be edited and disabled or enabled at any time. Disabling a "
"Power Schedule Policy will prevent the Power Schedule from running on the"
" Clouds Instances until re-enabled."
msgstr "Las políticas se peutn editar, deshabilitar ou habilitar dans cualquier momento. Deshabilitar una política de Planification d'alimentation evitará que la Planification d'alimentation se ejecute dans les Instances de les Clouds hasta que se vuelva a habilitar."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:70
msgid "ENFORCEMENT TYPE"
msgstr "TIPO DE APLICACIÓN"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:71
msgid ""
"User Configurable: Power Schedule choice is editable by User during "
"provisioning."
msgstr "Configurable por le utilisateur: La selección de Planification d'alimentation es editable por le Utilisateur durante le aprovisionamiento."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:72
msgid ""
"Fixed Schedule: User cannot change Power Schedule setting during "
"provisioning."
msgstr "Programación fija: El Utilisateur no peut cambiar la configuración de Planification d'alimentation durante le aprovisionamiento."

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:74
msgid "POWER SCHEDULE"
msgstr "PROGRAMACIÓN DE ENERGÍA"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:75
msgid ""
"Select Power Schedule to use in the Policy. Power schedule can be added "
"in |LibAutPow|"
msgstr "Sélectionnez la Planification d'alimentation a usar dans la política. Las programaciones de energía se peutn agregar dans |LibAutPow|"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:76
msgid "SCOPE"
msgstr "ALCANCE"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:77
msgid "Global"
msgstr "Global"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:78
msgid "Applies to all Instances created while the Policy is enabled"
msgstr "Se aplica a todas les Instances creadas mientras la política esté habilitada"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:79
msgid "Group"
msgstr "Groupe"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:80
msgid ""
"Applies to all Instances created in or moved into specified Group while "
"the Policy is enabled"
msgstr "Se aplica a todas les Instances creadas dans ou movidas au Grupo especificado mientras la política esté habilitada"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:81
msgid "Cloud"
msgstr "Cloud"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:82
msgid ""
"Applies to all Instances created in specified Cloud while the Policy is "
"enabled"
msgstr "Se aplica a todas les Instances creadas dans la Nube especificada mientras la política esté habilitada"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:83
msgid "User"
msgstr "Utilisateur"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:84
msgid ""
"Applies to all Instances created by specified User while the Policy is "
"enabled"
msgstr "Se aplica a todas les Instances creadas por le Utilisateur especificado mientras la política esté habilitada"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:85
msgid "Role"
msgstr "Rôle"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:86
msgid ""
"Applies to all Instances created by Users with specified Role while the "
"Policy is enabled"
msgstr "Se aplica a todas les Instances creadas por Utilisateurs avec le Rol especificado mientras la política esté habilitada"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:88
msgid "Permissions- TENANTS"
msgstr "Permisos- INQUILINOS"

#: ../../library/automation/power_scheduling.rst:89
msgid ""
"Leave blank to apply to all Tenants, or search for and select Tenants to "
"enforce the Policy on specific Tenants."
msgstr "Deje dans blanco pour aplicar a todos les Locataires, ou busque et seleccione Locataires pour aplicar la política dans Locataires específicos."

